{"title":"Yolkmobile MK2: Turbo","slug":"Yolkmobile_MK2%3A_Turbo","hero":{"file":"BoxedYolkmobileMK2-Turbo(NotCutOut).webp","width":400,"height":378},"pageid":4965,"revid":21264,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T06:15:27Z","lastEditor":"Maxwell Games 3","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Vehicles","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Building","value":"Hop 'N' Shop"},{"label":"Price","value":"🥚200"},{"label":"Speed","value":"101 studs/s"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v.1.102.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"},{"id":"history","text":"History"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Yolkmobile MK2: Turbo</b> is a car that looks like an <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Oakmobile/\">Oakmobile</a> in the shape of an egg and has three exhaust pipes. It can be purchased for <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggs/\">🥚</a>200 at the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hop_'N'_Shop/\">Hop 'N' Shop</a>.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li><b>Yolkmobile Mk2: Turbo</b> is one of the two hand-carrying <span data-unresolved=\"1\">Vehicles</span>, the other being the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Oakmobile/\">Oakmobile</a>;</li>\n<li>This is one of the fastest cars in the game (101 studs/s).</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"history\">History</h2>\n<ul><li>Was added on the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2026_Easter_Event/\">2026 Easter event</a>.</li></ul>"}
